orkStatusCallBack。这是回调处理体的顺序，不证明 native 的实际回调线程。","refs":[{"path":"analysis/decompiled/VM.PlatformSDKCS.Audit/VM.PlatformSDKCS/ProcessManager.cs","member":"ProcessManager.GetWorkStatusCallBackInfo","sha256":"06fee7c7b5387fea086abe5073be5dd2606ad121d9bc64b0ab9335bace100414","start":630,"end":652,"excerpt":"\tprivate void GetWorkStatusCallBackInfo(ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_MODULE_WORK_STAUS workStatuInfo)\n\t{\n\t\tif (workStatuInfo.nWorkStatus == 0)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tint num = (int)(workStatuInfo.nProcessID - 10000);\n\t\t\tif (num >= 0 && num \u003c 1000)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tmProcedureNormalFlag[num] = workStatuInfo.nIsExecuteNormal;\n\t\t\t\tmProcessRunFlag[num] = true;\n\t\t\t\tif (NumOfRunP2PFlag != 0)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tuint result = 0u;\n\t\t\t\t\tstring s = Encoding.Default.GetString(workStatuInfo.strReCommand);\n\t\t\t\t\tif (uint.TryParse(s, out result) && result \u003c 1024)\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmProcessRunP2PFlag[result] = true;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tOnWorkStatusCallBack?.Invoke(workStatuInfo);\n\t}\n","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":[],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P05","route":"原版 · 流程 Tab 单次","classification":"unknown","from":"IMVS_ExecuteOnce_V30","to":"原生拓扑执行与回调生产","behavior":"原生如何选节点、处理设备取消、形成状态及调用托管回调，不能由 P03/P04 两端推断。","refs":[],"unknowns":["缺导出内部调用链及实际回调生产路径；未运行原版。"],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"M01","route":"当前 · 运行","classification":"independent-implementation","from":"当前主工具栏 / 流程 Tab","to":"MainWindow.Run / RunProcedure","behavior":"工具栏调用 Run；Tab 捕获 procedure.Id 调用 RunProcedure。当前工具栏运行当前根流程，与 G01 全局脚本入口不能视为同构。","refs":[{"path":"src/VisionEditor/MainWindow.xaml.cs","member":"MainWindow toolbar construction","sha256":"034c0dae3e04a9b592031d87e1c1349c23b14091