nager → 四个不同native包装与非零抛错","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q05","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"RefreshUIStopExecute → Task.Run → StopExecute正常返回才置旗标 / SyncWaitor.Wait","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q06","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"两份Linux菜单Lang_RunSet → RunSet → 所选原方法为空","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q07","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"连续/停止native函数与等待实现 → 完整操作完成仍未证明","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q08","classification":"unknown"}]},{"title":"原版 · 等待重载与消息分发","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"RefreshUIStopExecute调用的Wait(ref bool) → 重复读标志 → PeekMessage / Translate / Dispatch 或 Sleep(1)","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q09","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"Wait数组 / 委托 / SyncWait重载 → 超时、休眠和消息取得方式分别保留","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q10","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"PrecisionWait两重载的bool分支 → true消息循环 / false计时精度调用与Sleep","kind":"edge","edgeId":"Q11","classification":"source-confirmed"}]},{"title":"原版 · 流程 Tab 单次","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"ProcedureConfigControl 流程Tab → 选中Tab的RunButtons → RunOnceCommand","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P00","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"VmProcedureDecorator.RunOnceCommandExe → VmProcedure.Run(null, false)","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P01","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"VmProcedure.Run(string,bool,bool) → ProcessManager.SyncExecuteOnce","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P02","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"SyncExecuteOnce → IMVS_ExecuteOnce_V30 / PrecisionWait","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P03","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"GetWorkStatusCallBackInfo → mProcessRunFlag / OnWorkStatusCallBack","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P04","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"IMVS_ExecuteOnce_V30 → 原生拓扑执行与回调生产","kind":"edge","edgeId":"P05","classification":"unknown"}]},{"title":"当前实现 · 流程运行","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"当前主工具栏 / 流程 Tab → MainWindow.Run / RunProcedure","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M01","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"StartRunCore → RunCore","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M02","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"SolutionExecutor.RunAsync → GraphExecutor.RunAsync","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M03","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"RunCore await 返回 → WorkflowCallbacks.PublishModuleResult","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M04","classification":"independent-implementation"}]},{"title":"当前实现 · 连续停止、回调队列与结果门","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"StartContinuous / ContinuousRun / 工具栏Stop → 单CTS循环、轮间策略与身份限定清理","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M05","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"RunCore → FrameworkCallbackQueue.PublishModuleResult → 同步保存结果 → Enqueue显示动作 → 宿主Dispatcher","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M06","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"FrameworkCallbackQueue缓存/扩容/worker/Close → 满容量丢弃、缓冲交换与关闭边界","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M07","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"RunCore返回bool / CreateExecutionProgress → NoMatch停止策略与动态端口runSequence门","kind":"edge","edgeId":"M08","classification":"independent-implementation"}]}]},{"title":"方案保存","kind":"subsystem","children":[{"title":"原版 · 主菜单保存与另存分支","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"保存/另存 Local/Native/Remote六包装 → 忙状态门 / ProjectManager调用 / bool为true才ResetParamStateFlag","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B01","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"ProjectManager.SaveSolution(Task,bool,bool) → 按/root路径与远程模式选复用路径或另存","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B02","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"AnotherSaveSolution旧密码门 / 选择器 → 主菜单取消false / 两种实际文件对话框","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B03","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"加密按钮button_Click / tempStrPassWord → 仅接受非空新密码 / 选择取消不在该方法清缓存","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B04","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"BeginSave(path,password,afterTask,remote) → 本地GetFullPath门 / Remote跳过 / 传给SaveSolution(path)","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B05","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"AnotherSaveSolution确认后的分支 → 显示进度flag与非显示进度的乐观true / 配置和最近列表顺序","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B06","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"SaveSolution(path,password,afterTask) → Export为true才发路径/名称通知并Start后续Task","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B07","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"主菜单ProjectManager.AnotherSaveSolution 与 ToolControl.SaveAsSolutionProcess → 同名另存的不同取消返回与临时密码入口策略","kind":"edge","edgeId":"B08","classification":"source-confirmed"}]},{"title":"原版 · 原生保存与完成通知","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"VmSolution.InternalExport → SolutionManager.SyncSaveSolution","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S01","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"TempVmSolution 静态构造 → OnSolutionSaveEndCallBack 订阅","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S02","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"SolutionManager.SyncSaveSolution → IMVS_SaveSolution / SyncWaitor.Wait","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S03","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"GetSolutionSaveEndCallBackInfo → 事件 → 状态码 → 完成旗标","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S04","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"VmSolution 保存完成订阅者 → 显示事件 / _isSaving=false","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S05","classification":"source-confirmed"},{"title":"IMVS_SaveSolution → 原生 .sol writer / 持久化事务","kind":"edge","edgeId":"S06","classification":"unknown"}]},{"title":"当前实现 · 独立格式保存","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"MainWindow.Save → GraphEditorDocument.Save","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J01","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"GraphEditorDocument.Save → SolutionStore.Save","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J02","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"SolutionStore.Save → 临时文件 → Flush(true) → File.Move","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J03","classification":"independent-implementation"}]},{"title":"当前实现 · 资产投影、提交边界与载入scope","kind":"evidence-lane","children":[{"title":"GraphEditorDocument.PrepareSave → ToolPluginRegistry参与者投影 → Rebase → JSON存储","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J04","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"doc.Save返回 / Shell.Save后续 → 文件提交、文档状态、Changed、偏好和最近记录分段","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J05","classification":"independent-implementation"},{"title":"GraphEditorDocument.Load / PrepareLoad → 解析/分离/恢复/校验 → 文档提交 → scope替换事件","kind":"edge","edgeId":"J06","classification":"independent-implementation"}]}]}]}};const names={'source-confirmed':'源码确认','independent-implementation':'当前独立实现',unknown:'未知'};const el=(tag,text)=>{const n=document.createElement(tag);if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=text;return n};for(const c of Object.keys(names)){const b=el('span',names[c]+' '+model.edges.filter(e=>e.classification===c).length);b.className='badge';document.getElementById('counts').append(b)}
 function show(e){document.querySelectorAll('.edge').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.id===e.id));const d=document.getElementById('detail');d.replaceChildren(el('h2',e.id+' · '+names[e.classification]),el('h3',e.from+' → '+e.to),el('p',e.behavior));if(e.unknowns.length){d.append(el('h3','仍需追踪'));const u=el('ul');for(const s of e.unknowns)u.append(el('li',s));d.append(u)}for(const r of e.refs){const x=el('details');x.append(el('summary',r.member+' · '+r.start+'–'+r.end),el('p',r.path),el('p',r.evidenceType+' · SHA-256 '+r.sha256),el('pre',r.excerpt));d.append(x)}d.append(el('p','静态检查；未执行运行验证；不声明 native 等价。'))}
 function route(value){document.querySelectorAll('#routes button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.textContent===value));const h=document.getElementById('edges');h.replaceChildren();const es=model.edges.filter(e=>e.route===value);for(const e of es){const b=el('button');b.type='button';b.dataset.id=e.id;b.className='edge '+e.classification;b.append(el('strong',e.id+' · '+e.from+' → '+e.to),el('small',names[e.classification]));b.onclick=()=>show(e);h.append(b)}show(es[0])}for(const value of [...new Set(model.edges.map(e=>e.route))]){const b=el('button',value);b.type='button';b.onclick=()=>route(value);document.getElementById('routes').append(b)}route(model.edges[0].route);
const hierarchyEdges=new Map(model.edges.map(e=>[e.id,e])),edgePaths=new Map();
const flatShow=show;show=function(e){flatShow(e);const detail=document.getElementById('detail'),crumb=el('div',(edgePaths.get(e.id)||[]).concat(e.id).join(' › '));crumb.className='crumb';detail.prepend(crumb);const leaf=document.querySelector('#hierarchy button[data-id="'+e.id+'"]');for(let p=leaf?.parentElement;p;p=p.parentElement)if(p.tagName==='DETAILS')p.open=true;document.querySelectorAll('#hierarchy .edge').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.id===e.id));history.replaceState(null,'','#edge-'+e.id)};
function treeBranch(node,trail=[],level=0){if(node.edgeId){edgePaths.set(node.edgeId,trail);const e=hierarchyEdges.get(node.edgeId),button=el('button');button.type='button';button.dataset.id=e.id;button.className='edge '+e.classification;button.append(el('strong',e.id+' · '+node.title),el('small',names[e.classification]));button.onclick=()=>{route(e.route);show(e)};return button}const d=el('details');d.open=level<2;d.dataset.level=String(level);d.append(el('summary',node.title));const branch=el('div');branch.className='branch';for(const child of node.children)branch.append(treeBranch(child,trail.concat(node.title),level+1));d.append(branch);return d}
document.getElementById('hierarchy').append(treeBranch(model.hierarchy));
function hierarchyMode(tree){document.getElementById('treePane').hidden=!tree;document.getElementById('routes').hidden=tree;document.getElementById('edges').hidden=tree;for(const [id,on]of [['treeMode',tree],['listMode',!tree]]){const b=document.getElementById(id);b.classList.toggle('active',on);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(on))}}
document.getElementById('treeMode').onclick=()=>hierarchyMode(true);document.getElementById('listMode').onclick=()=>hierarchyMode(false);document.getElementById('expandAll').onclick=()=>document.querySelectorAll('#hierarchy details').forEach(d=>d.open=true);document.getElementById('collapseAll').onclick=()=>document.querySelectorAll('#hierarchy details').forEach(d=>d.open=d.dataset.level==='0');hierarchyMode(true);function restoreEvidenceBookmark(){let key;try{key=decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1)).replace(/^edge-/,'')}catch{key=''}const desiredEdge=hierarchyEdges.get(key)||model.edges[0];route(desiredEdge.route);show(desiredEdge)}restoreEvidenceBookmark();addEventListener('hashchange',restoreEvidenceBookmark);
</script></html><script data-document-web src="document-web-links.js"></script>